          "do": "discover",
          "id": "arcade_toyplane_model"
        },
        {
          "do": "inspect",
          "title": "Toy Plane airframe",
          "text": "The jet on the display is the kind of asset Skye builds in Blender: an F-22 airframe, exported to the game, where Toy Plane reads plane models by name and gives every one the same toon finish for its colors and glow. That is how a hard-surface jet ends up looking like a toy.",
          "kicker": "Discovery"
        }
      ]
    },
