          "id": "arcade_canyon_run"
        },
        {
          "do": "inspect",
          "title": "Canyon Run",
          "text": "Canyon Run is the premise of Toy Plane in one picture. From the ground it is a gap between buildings; from a toy cockpit it is the course. The city is a model inside a house, so what looks like a canyon is a tabletop street, and at the transitions the real room shows through.",
          "kicker": "Discovery"
        }
      ]
    }
